# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# These apply ONLY to requests that reach the Pages hostname (www.playfundai.com).
# They cannot rescue a link pointing at the old playfundai.github.io address —
# that is a different origin and never reaches Cloudflare. Old GitHub Pages links
# are handled by the redirect shim at the repository root (/index.html), which is
# what GitHub Pages serves.
#
# Pages matches on the PATH only. A rule whose source contains a query string
# never fires, so ?code= style links are handled in page JavaScript instead, not
# here.

# The app used to live at /playfund-app/ on GitHub Pages. If anyone rewrites an
# old link by hand onto the new domain, land them in the right place. The splat
# keeps the rest of the path; query strings are carried over automatically.
/playfund-app/*        /app/:splat   301
